Cell["\<\
But invoking the disappearance of our sequence-delimiter when inside some \
other object, one can concatenate subsequences in an outer list:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.938273844415525*^9, 3.938273868977188*^9}, {
   3.938273904089712*^9, 3.9382739266943073`*^9}, {3.9419391417538223`*^9, 
