Cell["\<\
We can even produce Pascal's Triangle, grouped by rows, to any desired row. \
(Again, replacing the inner {} by the disappearing subsequence delimiters, \
[], would produce a single list.)\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.943349688742863*^9, 3.943349689599314*^9}, {
   3.943351233191304*^9, 3.943351291979307*^9}, {3.943351788396919*^9, 
