Cell["\<\
Figures 5 and 6 showcase examples of indexed concatenation with networks. \
Figure 5 provides several examples of networks that extend infinitely in one \
dimension, together with their concatenated EDSLs. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.947766643323372*^9, 3.9477666618945656`*^9}, {
   3.9478605435445232`*^9, 3.947860620399441*^9}, 
