  3.943271665508723*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"15794b72-7bf0-2340-9f72-\
d4c0ea891ad2"],

Cell["\<\
treatment of strings and integers has not yet been implemented in either \
direction.\
\>", "SubitemNumbered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.933250671238449*^9, 3.933250720122751*^9}, {
